    <briefdescription>
<para>Structure representing the definition of a numeric variable in a pattern. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It holds the pointer to the class instance holding the value and matching format of the numeric variable whose value is being defined and the number of the parenthesis group in RegExStr to capture that value. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
